  PageDescription2: `The Assessor's Office can provide a speaker for your organization's meetings. Topics include the property tax process, tax exemptions property owners may apply for, and other related issues.  In Order to most effectively serve you, please fill out the following form as completely as possible. We require at least a 2-week notice in order to accommodate your request.  If you have any questions or need further information, please contact <a href="mailto: speaker.request@assessor.lacounty.gov">speaker.request@assessor.lacounty.gov</a>`,
