  February15item: "Deadline for timely filing of affidavits and claims for exemptions (late after 5:00 PM; a postmark before midnight is considered timely) for personal and real property, including: Cemeteries \xB7 Colleges \xB7 Church and Religious \xB7 Exhibitors \xB7 Museums \xB7Owners of Historical Aircraft \xB7 Owners of Historical Wooden Vessels \xB7 Public Libraries \xB7 Public Schools \xB7 Welfare",
