  Paragraph2: 'Your AIN can be found on your tax bill, or by using the <a href="https://assessor.lacounty.gov/homeowners/property-search">Assessor - Property Search tool</a>. Once you have added your AIN to your account, you will begin to receive electronic notifications when a document is recorded with your linked AIN.',
